Country flag artwork
--------------------
The circular country badges use compact PNG derivatives of the country SVGs shipped with the
ZedSecure source tree. Original SVG source: flag-icons, https://github.com/lipis/flag-icons
Copyright (c) 2013 Panayiotis Lipiridis. License: MIT. The source SVGs are 4x3 country flags;
only format conversion and circular clipping are applied here.

